        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we consider the quality and timely delivery of our products, the service we provide to our customers, and the technical knowledge and skills of our personnel to be other important components of the portfolio of capabilities and assets supporting our ability to compete.",
        "start_character": 31522,
        "end_character": 31805
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In June 2025, the Company announced the sale of its PSI business to Crane Company, a diversified manufacturer of engineered industrial products.",
        "start_character": 16525,
        "end_character": 16669
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Production Solutions product line, we are leveraging our artificial lift technologies with our chemical solutions to provide an optimized and automated portfolio of production-enhancing solutions.",
        "start_character": 27130,
        "end_character": 27333
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our Subsea & Surface Pressure Systems product line, we continue to develop subsea production systems that improve performance and reduce emissions through lighter design, automated operations, and electrification.",
        "start_character": 27334,
        "end_character": 27550
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Specifically for OFSE, in our Well Construction product line, we are improving reliability in high-temperature and high shock and vibration environments (harsh-drilling conditions), through a combination of optimized design, automated operations, and integrated solutions that leverage our drilling tools, drill bits, and drilling fluids technologies.",
        "start_character": 26460,
        "end_character": 26811
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We engage in R&D activities across the business directed toward the development of new products, services, technology, and other solutions, as well as bringing about a significant improvement to existing products and services, and the design of specialized products to meet specific customer needs.",
        "start_character": 25526,
        "end_character": 25824
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Driving profitable growth: We are accelerating organic and inorganic growth by expanding our offering in high potential markets where we have differentiated solutions and in-demand capabilities for LNG, gas infrastructure, power generation, data centers, industrial manufacturing and oilfield production.",
        "start_character": 2754,
        "end_character": 3059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Transform the core: We are transforming our current business to improve margins and cash flow, which we are achieving through portfolio management, cost improvement, and new operating models.",
        "start_character": 2561,
        "end_character": 2753
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, because we operate through subsidiaries in non-U.S.",
        "start_character": 57450,
        "end_character": 57515
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At Baker Hughes, people are at the heart of what we do, and their adaptability is essential to fostering creativity and developing solutions that keep the Company at the forefront of the industry.",
        "start_character": 37493,
        "end_character": 37689
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001701605-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001701605-26-000007-54c27e8fefb257bc",
        "accession_number": "0001701605-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By integrating talent management processes, we enhance the employee experience through development opportunities and a supportive environment that fosters growth and creativity.",
